      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "So the boy picks up the snake, which bites him, and the boy starts to spasm and foam at the mouth as the other kids look on in horror.",
